                <pb facs="0157" n="37" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg37"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/998: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-01T17:00:00-05:00">July 1, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:09 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>91. Department’s 47, June 26, 7 p.m. Four millions made available to the
                    Government yesterday; actually in their hands today.</p>
                <p>Outstanding credits renewed for 90 days at 7 percent with the understanding that
                    increased rate of interest or payment of expenses will be taken up again
                    September 30.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
